  "description": "File-per-topic configuration for Zonit applications. AddAppData() folds every JSON file under AppData/Settings into the host's configuration — one file per concern instead of one appsettings.json where the Serilog section buries everything else — with per-environment overrides, gitignored *.local.json secrets, and reload-on-change wired in. Host-agnostic: extends IHostApplicationBuilder, so web, worker and console hosts all use the same call.",
